      ms: 9720
      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow'
    '|a||So: is the market fair? By Nozick''s test it can be, when the start and every step are clean. By Rawls''s, only if you''d choose its rules without knowing where you''d land.':
